Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.01,0:00:04.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I call the phenomenon "Revival."
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.18,0:00:13.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I go back in time by about one to five minutes\Nand watch the same scene play out again.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.55,0:00:16.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's always right before something bad happens.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.46,0:00:20.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As a result, I've prevented\Nseveral accidents from occurring.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.26,0:00:23.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ma.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you Fujinuma Satoru-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.90,0:00:38.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I need to take you down to the station.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.49,0:02:17.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you watch Maskman?\NNext week's the last episode.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.12,0:02:19.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I forgot to watch Black!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}1988...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.10,0:02:25.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}February the 15th?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.96,0:02:29.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.38,0:02:31.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.47,0:02:37.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Satoru? Take your seat already.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.17,0:02:40.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, r-right...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.25,0:02:42.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where was my seat, again?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.73,0:02:49.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you half-asleep, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.89,0:02:51.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's Hinazuki's desk.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.19,0:02:54.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Monday...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.93,0:02:56.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo's late again this week, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.59,0:03:02.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you like Kayo, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.69,0:03:07.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You two weirdos would make a perfect couple.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.88,0:03:09.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm taking attendance.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.71,0:03:11.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this real life?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.71,0:03:10.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Azuma.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.43,0:03:11.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.30,0:03:12.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Abiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.21,0:03:12.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.80,0:03:15.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did I end up here?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.80,0:03:13.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Abe.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.71,0:03:14.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.13,0:03:14.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Ikuta.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.91,0:03:15.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(810,52.5)}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.01,0:03:16.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1110,52.5)}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.68,0:03:17.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(810,52.5)}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.41,0:03:18.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1110,52.5)}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.01,0:03:18.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(810,52.5)}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.66,0:03:19.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1110,52.5)}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.25,0:03:19.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(810,52.5)}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.87,0:03:20.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1110,52.5)}Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.37,0:03:22.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're talking about 18 years ago here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.65,0:03:31.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How far did you get in Dragon Quest III?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.42,0:03:33.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm level 15 now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.02,0:03:34.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's all?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.38,0:03:36.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just kidding. I'm actually level 25.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.27,0:03:37.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.32,0:03:43.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's up, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.09,0:03:45.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My head kinda hurts.\NI'm going to the nurse's office.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.92,0:03:47.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,With your bag?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.31,0:03:54.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll let the teacher know.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.10,0:03:57.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.05,0:03:59.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this a Revival?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.90,0:04:01.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But why like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.64,0:04:04.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.13,0:04:12.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ma!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.63,0:04:39.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.54,0:04:41.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.86,0:04:47.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, just some stranger.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.31,0:04:53.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.37,0:04:56.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She would be at work.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.08,0:05:23.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ma...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.79,0:05:45.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ma.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.05,0:05:46.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"Ma"?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.05,0:05:49.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? I said "Mom."
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.19,0:05:50.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You silly goose.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.91,0:05:53.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want Hamburg steak\Nor meatballs for dinner?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hamburg steak.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.06,0:06:13.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be done soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.26,0:06:26.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just this morning, you threw a tantrum\N'cause your recorder was missing,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.85,0:06:28.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I guess you're over it already.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.23,0:06:31.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.27,0:06:35.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to have a cry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.06,0:06:45.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had times like these, too, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.43,0:06:47.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Had I forgotten about them?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.10,0:06:50.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I just hadn't realized.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.07,0:06:53.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Times I'd never given a second thought to...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.13,0:06:54.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And times I'd lost forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.07,0:06:59.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is definitely a Revival.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.14,0:07:03.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A second chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.85,0:07:09.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't ever let go of these times again.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.18,0:07:12.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.73,0:07:16.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was great. Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.48,0:07:18.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.16,0:07:19.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.88,0:07:28.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I going to relive 18 years of my life like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.52,0:07:29.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.86,0:07:31.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{Y-Yo}H-Hey, Osamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.95,0:07:35.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If this actually is a Revival,\NI must be here for a reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.98,0:07:38.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,{\i1}It must be to prevent \Nsomething bad from happening.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.31,0:07:42.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In other words, is this where\NI have to start to save Ma?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But why here?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.20,0:07:47.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't noticed anything wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.39,0:08:02.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.87,0:08:06.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She lived with her mother,\Nif my memory serves me right.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.21,0:08:09.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}That's awesome.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.56,0:08:10.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.10,0:08:16.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A bruise?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.23,0:08:20.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This group really is weird.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.55,0:08:22.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't talk about Dragon Quest with any of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.32,0:08:27.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, Hiro's more into Final Fantasy,\Nand Kazu only plays shooters.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.41,0:08:29.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hiro...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.93,0:08:30.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kazu...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm starting to remember.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.53,0:08:34.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And Satoru doesn't even have a Nintendo!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.53,0:08:36.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.75,0:08:41.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But, Osamu, you can't talk to fellow Dragon Quest\Nfans about anything but Dragon Quest, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.76,0:08:45.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I like this group because\Nwe're all into different things.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.91,0:08:47.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kenya.{should we use "Ken'ya"?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.18,0:08:49.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's a smart guy,\Njust like I thought he was back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Satoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.55,0:08:53.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mind if I ask you something?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.81,0:08:55.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.63,0:08:58.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you like Hinazuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.93,0:09:00.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were staring at her the whole time in class.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.64,0:09:02.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.27,0:09:06.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, he stopped and\Nstared at Hinazuki this morning, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.27,0:09:07.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's this, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.96,0:09:11.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you talk to us about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.03,0:09:12.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.53,0:09:13.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.37,0:09:16.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll set you up with Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,K-Keep it down!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.58,0:09:25.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, I wouldn't say that I like her,\Nbut she's been on my mind a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.04,0:09:26.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He said it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun, you've got guts!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well said, my boy!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.68,0:09:32.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get you to meet with her after school!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.75,0:09:36.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.63,0:09:37.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not pulling any punches, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.12,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\i1\an8}That's the first thing you've got to say?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's the first thing you've got to say?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.07,0:09:42.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.58,0:09:44.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn that Kazu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.00,0:09:47.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He went and told her straight up that I like her.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.30,0:09:51.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,L-Look...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.50,0:09:54.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe we could be friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.29,0:09:56.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We go home the same way, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.57,0:10:00.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What about me gave you that idea?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.29,0:10:03.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This brat is a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.65,0:10:06.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I kinda get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.59,0:10:08.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Because, Fujinuma,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.05,0:10:10.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,you're a fake, just like me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.13,0:10:14.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's with her?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.32,0:10:16.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is she saying?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.09,0:10:19.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I saw you running back home yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.10,0:10:23.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is your mother that important to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.74,0:10:26.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.07,0:10:28.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.22,0:10:33.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.52,0:10:36.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna be friends with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.36,0:10:38.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.15,0:10:40.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.77,0:10:43.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Could you kill someone for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.12,0:10:47.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I could've saved her!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.74,0:10:52.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki was in a bad situation even before she was murdered.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.26,0:10:58.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can right this wrong, then maybe...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.69,0:11:11.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Because, Fujinuma,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.65,0:11:14.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,you're a fake, just like me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.03,0:11:17.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not like she realized I'm posing as my past self.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.56,0:11:21.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While it's true that I was\Nwinging my way through life,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.30,0:11:23.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was the same back in elementary school, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.50,0:11:29.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was playing the role of my ideal self\Nso I could get along with people.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.04,0:11:31.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,Don't be embarrassed. Show some courage.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.34,0:11:39.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was all so I could fit into this cramped society.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.28,0:11:37.72,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.14,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Were you taking a dump in there?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.14,0:11:40.30,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\an8}No!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.43,0:11:41.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.96,0:11:43.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She must've seen through that.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.61,0:11:44.06,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\an8}I thought you'd fell in!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.06,0:11:45.99,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Probably clogged the thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.49,0:11:45.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She said "just like me,"
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.77,0:11:48.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which means she's probably the same.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.79,0:11:52.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've got the hots for her, huh, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.86,0:11:55.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, how'd it go with Hinazuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.62,0:11:57.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you manage to ask her to walk home together?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.66,0:12:01.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,N-Nah, we just chatted a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.04,0:12:02.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You chatted? Alone?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.98,0:12:03.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.49,0:12:06.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That means you've got a chance!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.04,0:12:08.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No way she'd talk to you alone otherwise!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.98,0:12:10.95,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\q2}{\an8}Is there anything else you want me to tell her for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.55,0:12:10.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How irritating.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.95,0:12:12.75,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\an8}This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.95,0:12:12.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How am I supposed to deal with these morons?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.75,0:12:14.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Quit fooling around, you guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.70,0:12:16.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What if you rush it and ruin things for him?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.62,0:12:18.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.55,0:12:22.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's still way off, but I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.37,0:12:23.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.87,0:12:27.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll all still be in the same class\N in sixth grade, so take it slow and steady.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.92,0:12:28.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.64,0:12:32.50,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\an8}School will be closing shortly.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.60,0:12:35.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to think of it, when did Hinazuki disappear?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time could be running out.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.57,0:12:37.32,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Let's go, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.32,0:12:38.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,C-Coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.94,0:12:40.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a new pair of McGregor gloves?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.80,0:12:47.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh yeah, I did have those.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.83,0:12:50.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think I left them somewhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.12,0:12:53.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Probably at the hideout.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.58,0:12:56.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You guys wanna stop by the hideout?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.46,0:12:57.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.78,0:13:01.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We decided we wouldn't go right after\Nsnowfall because we'd leave footprints.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.21,0:13:03.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I-Is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.03,0:13:09.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.02,0:13:09.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.97,0:13:13.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kenya!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.74,0:13:16.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.07,0:13:19.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it bugs me when people\Nmake a big deal out of things.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.91,0:13:21.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.02,0:13:26.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.66,0:13:29.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but I get this feeling that
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.07,0:13:31.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki being on your mind\Nis something really important.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.65,0:13:35.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This might not be any of my business,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.85,0:13:37.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but you can talk to us if you need anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.30,0:13:41.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure all of us want to help you out.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.46,0:13:43.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure. Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.47,0:13:45.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I get that they don't mean any harm.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.43,0:13:49.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was thanks to Kazu that\NI got to talk to Hinazuki, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So, how'd it really go?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.95,0:13:53.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,With Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you get to talk to her?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.15,0:13:58.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.19,0:14:01.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think she spoke to me from the heart a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.69,0:14:02.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.11,0:14:05.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Lately, have you...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.46,0:14:09.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,read the student anthology?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.86,0:14:13.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,N-No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.20,0:14:14.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's actually pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.82,0:14:16.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go through it sometime.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.59,0:14:19.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.01,0:14:29.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kenya was probably referring to Hinazuki's essay.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.80,0:14:35.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"The Town With Only Me Erased," by Hinazuki Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.88,0:14:41.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I grow older, old enough\Nto go wherever I want by myself,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.10,0:14:43.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to a faraway country.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.16,0:14:44.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to a faraway island.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.49,0:14:47.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to an island with nobody around.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.51,0:14:52.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to an island\Nwith no sorrow or suffering.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.79,0:14:59.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An island without adults, children,\Nclassmates, teachers, or Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.65,0:15:04.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On that island, I'll climb a tree when I want,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}swim in the ocean when I want,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.34,0:15:09.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and sleep when I want.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.86,0:15:14.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And on that island, I'll think about the town\Nfrom which only I've been erased.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.31,0:15:17.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kids will go to school as always,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.47,0:15:20.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}adults will go to work as always,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.69,0:15:25.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Mom will have dinner as always.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.40,0:15:30.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I think about the town from which\NI've been erased, I feel lighthearted.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go far, far away.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.04,0:15:39.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki's essay is most definitely an SOS.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.74,0:15:41.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.90,0:15:43.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.99,0:15:48.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kenya probably thinks\NI took an interest in Hinazuki
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.78,0:15:52.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}not because I have a crush on her,\Nbut because I read her essay.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.99,0:15:53.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.97,0:15:55.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.08,0:15:58.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,On my birthday, can I invite\Nsome friends over and have a party?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.24,0:16:00.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.43,0:16:03.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But we can't fit too many in this tiny apartment.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.33,0:16:05.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Only need room for about five.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.78,0:16:08.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is the first time you've\Never asked for anything like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.87,0:16:09.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wanna get a big cake?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.28,0:16:11.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.85,0:16:17.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What I'm supposed to do now\Nis dig deep and get closer to Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.25,0:16:20.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll do things I never did in the past,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.34,0:16:24.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}change Hinazuki's actions that way,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.04,0:16:27.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and prevent all the incidents\Nthat occur around me in the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.61,0:16:30.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I keep that up...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.40,0:16:34.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, you awake?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Five people?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.24,0:16:38.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.57,0:16:41.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What, you're asleep?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.41,0:16:42.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's a demon.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.06,0:16:45.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That reminds me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.29,0:16:52.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never showed Mom my essay because\NI couldn't stand the gaze of her all-seeing eye.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.16,0:16:54.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did I write about, again?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.95,0:17:00.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right, time to go home and play Dragon Quest!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.89,0:17:01.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.93,0:17:03.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's snowing again?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.08,0:17:04.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We can't go to the hideout.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, Hinazuki's leaving.\NShouldn't you go after her?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.59,0:17:09.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Osamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.72,0:17:12.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Kenya. I will go after her.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.11,0:17:13.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Osamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.55,0:17:14.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.51,0:17:15.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.87,0:17:19.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun's got guts!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.39,0:17:24.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No need to run.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.10,0:17:26.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know just where to find Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.22,0:17:30.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suspect she's being abused by her mother,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.83,0:17:36.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which is why she doesn't want to go home\Nand loiters at that park until it gets dark.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.98,0:17:41.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I just thought she was a weird girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.23,0:17:48.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.44,0:17:51.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.82,0:17:53.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.67,0:17:55.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right back at you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.97,0:17:57.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I said I wanna be friends with you, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.93,0:18:02.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't murder anyone for you, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.61,0:18:04.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was obviously kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.26,0:18:06.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yikes. I have trouble with these types.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.38,0:18:11.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're, like, putting on an act, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.18,0:18:13.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pretending to smile.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.44,0:18:14.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pretending to be nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.93,0:18:16.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pretending to be worried.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.16,0:18:19.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.31,0:18:22.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm one to talk,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I can't see the real you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.46,0:18:29.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're probably right.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.36,0:18:30.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I am putting on an act.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.77,0:18:33.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want people to like me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.33,0:18:35.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.03,0:18:38.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm bad with people, so I thought about\Nwhat I could do to achieve that.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.76,0:18:44.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And I figured I could try liking everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.09,0:18:48.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When I did, putting on that act got a little easier.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.82,0:18:56.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I feel like if you play a part,\Nit'll eventually become a part of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.90,0:19:00.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,I feel like if you say something\Nout loud, it'll eventually come true.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.75,0:19:04.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,{\i1}It's just like what Airi said,\Nwhich made me feel nostalgic.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.07,0:19:08.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In order to get what they want,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.27,0:19:12.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}everyone puts up with things,\Nmakes an effort, and picks up skills.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.41,0:19:14.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When they fall, they pick themselves back up.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.61,0:19:16.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki must be the same.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.85,0:19:18.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bet she's bearing something right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.75,0:19:22.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unlike me, she's putting on a stoic act.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.71,0:19:25.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She acts as if she feels nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.09,0:19:30.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there's no way a girl who's only\Nten years old could be that strong.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.16,0:19:32.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.45,0:19:33.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.78,0:19:37.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing a birthday party.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.83,0:19:39.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You should come.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.07,0:19:42.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure you want me to?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.22,0:19:44.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A lot of other people will be there, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.24,0:19:45.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.67,0:19:47.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I decided to ask you first.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.45,0:19:51.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's on March 2nd.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.07,0:19:55.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You'll come, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.17,0:19:58.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.51,0:20:02.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma, aren't your hands cold?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.69,0:20:05.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,W-Well, they are...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.90,0:20:08.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like I left my gloves somewhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.65,0:20:18.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey. You're 29 years old. Get a hold of yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What are you blushing for?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.53,0:20:23.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma, I'm done.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.52,0:20:27.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My hand's a little bigger than yours, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.42,0:20:28.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.10,0:20:30.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.13,0:20:35.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're kinda easy to talk to lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.18,0:20:38.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.32,0:20:40.80,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,{\i1\an8}I did decide not to lie to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.32,0:20:40.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I did decide not to lie to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.82,0:20:43.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.72,0:20:49.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.21,0:20:50.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.11,0:20:53.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She wasn't wearing gloves either.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.34,0:21:02.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is where I last saw Hinazuki 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.70,0:21:07.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,150,,{\i1}I think her body was only\Nfound after the snow melted.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.12,0:21:13.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let Hinazuki be alone in this park.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.83,0:21:15.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.25,0:21:18.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to change the future!
